================================================================================
abTEM (the reference; the algorithms of slice 1 are ported from it)
================================================================================

The projected potential (the infinite projection of the Lobato
parameterisation with abTEM's bilinear deltas and compensation function), the
slicing rules, the transmission function, the Fresnel propagator with its
antialias aperture, the multislice step, the probe (soft aperture, polar
aberrations, position kernel, normalisation), the diffraction-pattern crop and
the CODATA 2014 constants and evaluation order of the wavelength and the
interaction parameter are ported from abTEM 1.0.10 (tag v1.0.10, commit
164e644ff411167db23ec4ef26aeb4fe8f384b26), and checked against it by
tools/slice-1/pins.py. The Lobato table in
Sources/SimulatoMultislice/LobatoTable.swift is generated from abTEM's
abtem/parametrizations/data/lobato.json.

    abTEM - https://github.com/abtem/abtem
