================================================================================
The Lobato and Van Dyck parameterisation
================================================================================

    I. Lobato, D. Van Dyck, "An accurate parameterization for scattering
    factors, electron densities and electrostatic potentials for neutral atoms
    that obey all physical constraints", Acta Cryst. A 70, 636-649 (2014),
    doi:10.1107/S205327331401643X. Parameters are published numbers, cited as
    such.

================================================================================
Text
================================================================================

    E. J. Kirkland, Advanced Computing in Electron Microscopy, 2nd ed.,
    Springer (2010): the method, and the tabulated wavelengths and interaction
    parameters used as truth.

